{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49449","headline":"小重山 二 · 薛昭藴","name":"小重山 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋到长门秋草黄，画梁双燕去，出宫墙。\n玉箫无复理霓裳，金蝉坠，鸾镜掩休妆。\n忆昔在昭阳，舞衣红绶带，绣鸳鸯。\n至今犹惹御炉香，魂梦断，愁听漏更长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛昭藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49449.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49449","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}